      "solution": {
        "status": "ambiguous",
        "reasoning": "The base case holds because 1^2=1>0. For k\\ge1, the inductive hypothesis gives (k+1)^2=k^2+2k+1>2k-2+2k+1=4k-1>2k=2(k+1)-2. Thus induction proves the statement for every integer n\\ge1, so field-14 is option 2. Fields 1–13 have captured Correct grades; field-14 has no captured answer or grade yet.",
