-32 568 -40H471Q464 -40 446 -40T417 -41Q262 -41 172 45Q84 127 84 250Z\"></path>\n<path stroke-width=\"1\" id=\"E5-MJAMS-4E\" d=\"M20 664Q20 666 31 683H142Q256 683 258 681Q259 680 279 653T342 572T422 468L582 259V425Q582 451 582 490T583 541Q583 611 573 628T522 648Q500 648 493 654Q484 665 493 679L500 683H691Q702 676 702 666Q702 657 698 652Q688 648 680 648Q633 648 627 612Q624 601 624 294V-8Q616 -20 607 -20Q601 -20 596 -15Q593 -13 371 270L156 548L153 319Q153 284 153 234T152 167Q152 103 156 78T172 44T213 34Q236 34 242 28Q253 17 242 3L236 -1H36Q24 6 24 16Q24 34 56 34Q58 35 69 36T86 40T100 50T109 72Q111 83 111 345V603L96 619Q72 643 44 648Q20 648 20 664ZM413 419L240 648H120L136 628Q137 626 361 341T587 54L589 68Q589 78 589 121V192L413 419Z\"></path>\n</defs>\n<g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 0)\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n <use xlink:href=\"#E5-MJMATHI-6E\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\"></use>\n <use xlink:href=\"#E5-MJMAIN-2208\" x=\"878\" y=\"0\"></use>\n <use xlink:href=\"#E5-MJAMS-4E\" x=\"1823\" y=\"0\"></use>\n</g>\n</svg></span></p>\n</blockquote>\n<p>We start by proving the so-called base case. Since we are required to prove the statement for <span class=\"mjpage\"><svg xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\" width=\"6.302ex\" height=\"2.509ex\" style=\"vertical-align: -0.671ex;\" viewBox=\"0 -791.3 2713.6 1080.4\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" aria-labelledby=\"MathJax-SVG-6-Title\">\n<title id=\"MathJax-SVG-6-Title\">n \\geq 1,</title>\n<defs aria-hidden=\"true\">\n<path stroke-width=\"1\" id=\"E6-MJMATHI-6E\" d=\"M21 287Q22 293 24 303T36 341T56 388T89 425T135 442Q171 442 195 424T225 390T231 369Q231 367 232 367L243 378Q304 442 382 442Q436 442 469 415T503 336T465 179T427 52Q427 26 444 26Q450 26 453 27Q482 32 505 65T540 145Q542 153 560 153Q580 153 580 145Q580 144 576 130Q568 101 554 73T508 17T439 -10Q392 -10 371 17T350 73Q350 92 386 193T423 345Q423 404 379 404H374Q288 404 229 